<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TolE0214">
          <l>toṭara liṟuti tammuṟ ṟāmvariṉ</l>
          <l>lakaram ṟakaravoṟ ṟākalu murittē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l><foreign xml:lang="ta">La</foreign> of the standing words may be changed to <foreign xml:lang="ta">ṟ,</foreign></l>
<l>if they are not <foreign xml:lang="ta">toṭar</foreign> and are followed by the same [words].<note place="foot">That is, <foreign xml:lang="ta">pal</foreign> followed by <foreign xml:lang="ta">pala,</foreign> and <foreign xml:lang="ta">cil</foreign> by <foreign xml:lang="ta">cila,</foreign> will result in <foreign xml:lang="ta">paṟpala</foreign>
          and <foreign xml:lang="ta">ciṟcila ;</foreign> in this case, they are <foreign xml:lang="ta">toṭar al,</foreign> i.e. ' not <foreign xml:lang="ta">toṭar '.</foreign></note></l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
